Subject: Select original scrolling specular material for native static models
Upstream-base: 443164c91fded218656a8443432e642fdad57838

Retain the original scrolling, specular, diffuse-lighting modes and shadow TEV
recipes. Use bounded native arrays and typed FIFO calls, explicit preview view
and time inputs, and fresh specular-light state on activation. Reset registry
state on destruction. Console vertex formats and FIFO operations are retained.
Task scheduling, frame timing and complete world loading are separate work.

